---
layout: base
permalink: /index.html
title: 'Stefan Taitano'
description: 'Army veteran, ServiceNow consultant, and Ruby learner writing about code, work, and life outside both.'
articles:
  title: 'Recent Articles'
  intro: 'A few things I have written lately.'
---

<div class="wrapper">
  <header class="full | section" style="--spot-color: var(--color-primary)">
    <div class="home-hero__inner section__inner flow region">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div
          style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-xl); align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap;"
        >
          <div class="home-hero__content flow" style="flex: 1; min-inline-size: 28ch; max-inline-size: 62ch;">
            <h1 class="home-hero__title" style="color: var(--color-light);">I build systems for a living and escape plans for fun.</h1>
            <p class="handwritten" style="color: var(--color-light); opacity: 0.9;">
              (right now that means Ruby, running, and planning our next move)
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--size-step-1); color: var(--color-light); opacity: 0.95;">
              I'm Stefan. I spent nine years in the Army, now work in ServiceNow, and am slowly getting better at Ruby.
            </p>
            <div class="home-hero__actions cluster gutter-s">
              <a href="/resume/" class="button" data-button-variant="tertiary">View my résumé</a>
              <a href="{{ personal.platforms.github }}" class="button" data-ghost-button rel="me">See my GitHub</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <figure
            aria-label="Stefan Taitano"
            style="flex-shrink: 0; inline-size: min(260px, 100%); aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; border: 4px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-light) 35%, transparent);"
          >
            <img
              src="/assets/images/stefan.png"
              alt="Stefan Taitano"
              width="260"
              height="260"
              style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 20%;"
            >
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% svg "divider/waves", null, "divider" %}
  </header>

  <section id="now-preview" class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div
        class="flow"
        style="background: var(--color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-bg-accent-2); border-radius: var(--border-radius-medium); padding: var(--space-l);"
      >
        <p class="handwritten" style="font-size: var(--size-step-1); color: var(--color-primary);">
          What I'm doing now
        </p>
        <div class="flow">
          <p>
            RubyConf 2026 is in the books. I volunteered and gave my first
            <a href="/talks/rubyconf-2026/">conference lightning talk about showing up before feeling ready</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm still working through <a href="https://www.theodinproject.com/">The Odin Project</a> Ruby path and
            looking for another chance to help out while I learn.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p><a href="/now/">See the full /now page</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow">
      <div class="flow">
        <p class="handwritten" style="font-size: var(--size-step-1); color: var(--color-primary);">
          Explore the site
        </p>
        <h2>Start here.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid" style="--grid-placement: auto-fit; --grid-min-item-size: 16rem;">
        <a
          href="/articles/"
          style="display: block; padding: var(--space-l); border: 1px solid var(--color-bg-accent-2); border-radius: var(--border-radius-medium); text-decoration: none;"
        >
          <strong>Articles</strong>
          <p style="margin-top: var(--space-xs);">ServiceNow, Ruby, and whatever else is on my mind.</p>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/projects/"
          style="display: block; padding: var(--space-l); border: 1px solid var(--color-bg-accent-2); border-radius: var(--border-radius-medium); text-decoration: none;"
        >
          <strong>Projects</strong>
          <p style="margin-top: var(--space-xs);">This site, a Python game, and whatever I build next.</p>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/#newsletter"
          style="display: block; padding: var(--space-l); border: 1px solid var(--color-bg-accent-2); border-radius: var(--border-radius-medium); text-decoration: none;"
        >
          <strong>Field Notes</strong>
          <p style="margin-top: var(--space-xs);">An occasional email about Ruby, work, and life outside the browser.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="full | region">
    <div class="prose wrapper flow">
      <h2>{{ articles.title }}</h2>
      {% set itemList = collections.allPosts %}
      {% if itemList.length > 0 %}
        {% if articles.intro %}
          <p>{{ articles.intro }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      {% else %}
        <p>
          The archive is just getting started. For now, you can browse <a href="/articles/">the articles page</a>
          or read newer writing on <a href="https://medium.com/@stefantaitano">Medium</a>.
        </p>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="feature | region region-space-l">
        {% if itemList.length > 0 %}
          <custom-masonry layout="50-50">
            {% asyncEach item in itemList.slice(0, 3) %}
              {% set headingLevel = "h3" %}
              {% include "partials/card-blog.njk" %}
            {% endeach %}
          </custom-masonry>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <p><a href="/articles/">Browse all articles</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects" class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow">
      <div class="flow">
        <p class="handwritten" style="font-size: var(--size-step-1); color: var(--color-primary);">
          Things I'm building
        </p>
        <h2>Projects</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" style="--grid-placement: auto-fit; --grid-min-item-size: 16rem;">
        {% for project in projects %}
          {% if not project.draft %}
            <article class="project-card flow">
              <strong>{{ project.title }}</strong>
              <div class="project-card__meta" aria-label="Project status and date">
                <span>{{ project.status }}</span>
                <span>{{ project.date }}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cluster gutter-xs" style="flex-wrap: wrap;">
                {% for tag in project.tech %}
                  <span class="project-card__tag">{{ tag }}</span>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
              <p style="margin-top: var(--space-xs);">{{ project.description }}</p>
              <div class="cluster gutter-s" style="margin-top: var(--space-s);">
                {% if project.url %}
                  <a href="{{ project.url }}" style="font-size: var(--size-step-min-1);">View {{ project.title }} live &rarr;</a>
                {% endif %}
                {% if project.article %}
                  <a href="{{ project.article }}" style="font-size: var(--size-step-min-1);">Read how I built it &rarr;</a>
                {% endif %}
                {% if project.repo %}
                  <a href="{{ project.repo }}" style="font-size: var(--size-step-min-1);">View {{ project.title }} source &rarr;</a>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p><a href="/projects/">See all projects</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="full | region">
    <div class="prose wrapper flow">
      <h2>A bit more about me</h2>
      <p>
        Before tech, I spent nine years in the United States Army as a Fire Control Specialist. I also led a small
        team, managed programs, and learned that clear documentation matters most when something breaks.
      </p>
      <p>
        These days I work as a ServiceNow Technical Consultant. Outside of work, I'm learning Ruby through
        The Odin Project. I gave my first <a href="/talks/rubyconf-2026/">RubyConf lightning talk</a> in 2026.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm away from a laptop, I'm usually reading, running, or losing a rapid game on Lichess.
      </p>
      <div class="cluster" style="margin-block-start: var(--space-m);">
        <a href="/resume/" class="button" data-button-variant="primary">View my résumé</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="newsletter" class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper">
      {% include "partials/newsletter-cta.njk" %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% css "local" %}
  {% include "css/home.css" %}
  {% include "css/projects.css" %}
{% endcss %}
